.TH "GNOME\-SESSION\-QUIT" "1" "" "gnome-session" "User Commands"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.\" http://bugs.debian.org/507673
.\" http://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/groff/2009-02/msg00013.html
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * set default formatting
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" disable hyphenation
.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gnome-session-quit \- End the current GNOME session
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBgnome\-session\-quit\fR\ 'u
\fBgnome\-session\-quit\fR [OPTION...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBgnome\-session\-quit\fR
can be used to end a GNOME session\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Print help and exit
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-logout\fR
.RS 4
Prompt the user to confirm logout\&. This is the default behavior\&. Cannot be combined with
\fB\-\-power\-off\fR
or
\fB\-\-reboot\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-power\-off\fR
.RS 4
Prompt the user to confirm system power off\&. Cannot be combined with
\fB\-\-logout\fR
or
\fB\-\-reboot\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-reboot\fR
.RS 4
Prompt the user to confirm system reboot\&. Cannot be combined with
\fB\-\-logout\fR
or
\fB\-\-power\-off\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-force\fR
.RS 4
Ignore any inhibitors\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-no\-prompt\fR
.RS 4
End the session without user interaction\&. This only works with
\fB\-\-logout\fR\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBgnome-session\fR(1)
